the compiled image's boot chain is not the one the compiler placed: expected "CB_A" at 0x8000 (0x400 bytes), "CD" at 0x8400 (0x400 bytes), "CD" at 0x8800 (0x400 bytes), "CE" at 0x8c00 (0x404 bytes); got "CB_A" at 0x8000 (0x400 bytes), "CB_B" at 0x8400 (0x400 bytes), "CD" at 0x8800 (0x400 bytes), "CE" at 0x8c00 (0x404 bytes)
